1
00:00:00,380 --> 00:00:02,290
Before the show starts,
there's somewhere I want to go.

2
00:00:02,290 --> 00:00:04,630
Huh? Where?

3
00:00:04,630 --> 00:00:06,510
To see your mother.

4
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:22,520
What was she like?

5
00:00:22,520 --> 00:00:24,400
She always worked so hard.

6
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:27,070
She was always there to cheer me on.

7
00:00:28,070 --> 00:00:29,860
Minato's mother,

8
00:00:29,860 --> 00:00:32,320
thank you for bringing Minato into this world.

9
00:00:32,620 --> 00:00:34,870
You're exaggerating.

10
00:00:35,660 --> 00:00:38,120
Minato will become an actor.

11
00:00:38,120 --> 00:00:40,830
A truly great actor.

12
00:00:41,040 --> 00:00:44,040
I'll make sure his dream comes true.

13
00:00:46,340 --> 00:00:48,420
I'll always stay by his side,

14
00:00:48,420 --> 00:00:50,590
supporting him every step of the way.

15
00:00:51,720 --> 00:00:53,800
Senpai...

16
00:00:56,100 --> 00:00:57,810
Please,

17
00:00:57,810 --> 00:01:00,230
watch over him from above.

18
00:01:01,900 --> 00:01:03,190
Mom,

19
00:01:03,900 --> 00:01:05,270
I'm going to give it my all.

20
00:01:10,820 --> 00:01:14,320
(Twelfth Night Performance
Today at 4:00 PM - Sold Out)
